# Docker build context is sent to the daemon up-front, so we must
# exclude the experiment data (scripts/experiments/ is ~5.5T) and
# any other large/irrelevant paths. The image itself only COPYs
# entrypoint.sh — everything else lives behind volume mounts at
# runtime (see docker-compose*.yml). When in doubt: exclude.

# Default: ignore everything ...
*

# ... then re-include only what the Dockerfile actually needs.
!Dockerfile
!entrypoint.sh
